# Archived Zárójel implementation

The original terminal-based `/zarojel` experience has been superseded by `ZarojelVideoClient`.

- Original source file: `app/zarojel/ZarojelTerminalClient.tsx`
- Replacement entrypoint: `app/zarojel/page.tsx`
- New client: `app/zarojel/ZarojelVideoClient.tsx`

Keep this file as the archive marker for the old implementation.
